editor_description = "Sprouting footprints (Vegetables): 3 stems spring up in the foot's shape, their two seed leaves uncurl open, then flop and wilt from 0.6 of the 3.0 s life; fade from 0.8; 30 kept; 3 layouts. placeholder: life, max_marks and every number here are the old wardrobe.json / trail script numbers; the meshes are boxes of the old meshes' size until assets/19 (core/144; the clip and particle curves are authored in the editor)."
